      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Phase 7: QA Architect\nGenerates test strategy + critical test scenarios (markdown) based on BRD + Solution + PRD context.\nArtifacts:\n- test_strategy_md\n- test_scenarios_md",
        "height": 130,
